B.dvE=new A.T("Recebes \u20ac{0} desta entrega. Os \u20ac{1} que o cliente paga N\xc3O s\xe3o teus \u2014 recolhes em m\xe3o por conta da Bora, que acerta contigo no fim da semana.","You get \u20ac{0} for this delivery. The \u20ac{1} the customer pays are NOT yours \u2014 you collect them for Bora, which settles with you at the end of the week.")
